If no eligible rank is available from the immediately preceding season, the most recent earlier season for which such a rank is available shall be used.

For Role Queue, the copyright holder's highest eligible Role Queue rank from the applicable previous season shall be used.

For Open Queue, only the copyright holder's eligible Open Queue rank from the applicable previous season shall be used.

A provisional, predicted, estimated, or expected placement rank of the copyright holder shall not be used unless the copyright holder expressly publishes that rank as reference evidence for purposes of this License.

