(a) the most recent completed competitive season for which a qualifying rank can be reasonably verified;

(b) if unavailable, the next most recent completed competitive season for which a qualifying rank can be reasonably verified; and

(c) continuing backward in chronological order until qualifying evidence is found.

The age of a previous-season rank does not by itself make the rank invalid, provided that it is the most recent eligible and reasonably verifiable rank available under the applicable circumstances.

